    "title": "Competitor knocked timer into lap",
    "url": "https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/incidents/107",
    "date": "2024-05-31T10:54:50.000Z",
    "content": "Towards the end of a solve, when the competitor went to stop the timer, they bumped it with the puzzle and the timer fell into their lap before stopping the timer. The delegates awarded a *provisional* extra, but kept the original result. \n\nThe decision was made to keep the original result (not use the provisional), as it was deemed that it was the competitor's fault for knocking over the timer.",
